{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "Gal Kleinman <gal@traceloop.com>, Nir Gazit <nir@traceloop.com>, Tomer Friedman <tomer@traceloop.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "# OpenTelemetry LanceDB Instrumentation\n\n<a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb/\">\n    <img src=\"https://badge.fury.io/py/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb.svg\">\n</a>\n\nThis library allows tracing client-side calls to LanceDB sent with the official [LanceDB library](https://github.com/lancedb/lancedb).\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb\n```\n\n## Example usage\n\n```python\nfrom opentelemetry.instrumentation.lancedb import LanceInstrumentor\n\nLanceInstrumentor().instrument()\n```\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": "Apache-2.0", "license_files": null, "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb/", "project_urls": {"Repository": "https://github.com/traceloop/openllmetry/tree/main/packages/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb"}, "provides_extra": ["instruments"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-lancedb/0.63.1/", "requires_dist": ["opentelemetry-api<2,>=1.38.0", "opentelemetry-instrumentation>=0.59b0", "opentelemetry-semantic-conventions-ai<0.6.0,>=0.5.1", "opentelemetry-semantic-conventions>=0.63b1", "lancedb; extra == \"instruments\""], "requires_python": "<4,>=3.10", "summary": "OpenTelemetry Lancedb instrumentation", "version": "0.63.1", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.2